	abstract = {We introduce scEC\&T-seq, a new single-cell sequencing method that enables parallel profiling of extrachromosomal circular DNA and mRNAs in single cells. Using scEC\&T-seq, we characterized all types of circular DNA elements in single human cancer cells and profiled the intercellular heterogeneity and structural dynamics of cancer-specific extrachromosomal DNA.},
